flowchart TB
    Application[Application<br/>intent · user value · root predicates]
    Harness[Harness<br/>model-driven task execution semantics]
    Infrastructure[Infrastructure<br/>model-call and runtime computation]
    Model[Model<br/>inference and learned selection capability]
    World[Tools / external world<br/>effects and observations]

    Application --> Harness
    Harness --> Model
    Model --> Harness
    Harness --> Infrastructure
    Infrastructure --> Model
    Harness --> World
    World --> Harness

    Rule[Classify the mechanism by its controlled object<br/>not by vendor or feature name]
    Rule -.-> Harness
